freeVariables -- free variables of a triangular set
***************************************************

  * Usage: 
        freeVariables T
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note TriaSystem: TriaSystem,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of free variables of T

Description
===========

The free variables of $T$ are the ones that do not appear as the *note main
variable: mvar, of a polynomial in $T$.

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, MonomialOrder=>Lex]; |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = {a*d - b*c, c*f - d*e, e*h - f*g};       |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : H = {d, f, h};                               |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : T = triaSystem(R,F,H)                        |
|                                                  |
|o4 = {a*d - b*c, c*f - d*e, e*h - f*g} / {d, f, h}|
|                                                  |
|o4 : TriaSystem                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : freeVariables T                              |
|                                                  |
