mvar -- main variable of a polynomial
*************************************

  * Usage: 
        mvar f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the main variable of
        f

Description
===========

Returns the main variable of a polynomial $f$, i.e., the largest variable that
appears in $f$.

+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x_0..x_3, MonomialOrder=>Lex];                |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = x_1^2*(x_2*x_3+2*x_3) + x_1*(x_2^2-1) + (x_2-x_3)|
|                                                          |
|      2         2        2                                |
|o2 = x x x  + 2x x  + x x  - x  + x  - x                  |
|      1 2 3     1 3    1 2    1    2    3                 |
|                                                          |
|o2 : R                                                    |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : mvar f                                               |
|                                                          |
|o3 = x                                                    |
|      1                                                   |
|                                                          |
|o3 : R                                                    |
+----------------------------------------------------------+


