x.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y];                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = x^4                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|      4                                                                      |
|o2 = x                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : g = x^2*y + 13*x^2*y^4 +x*y^2-3*x - 1                                   |
|                                                                             |
|        2 4    2       2                                                     |
|o3 = 13x y  + x y + x*y  - 3x - 1                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : pseudoRemainder(x,f,g)                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|        27    6    87    4     2    3    14  4    27    2     6         6  2 |
|o4 = - ----x*y  + ----x*y  - ----x*y  + ----y  - ----x*y  + ----x*y - ----y  |
|       2197       2197       2197       2197     2197       2197      2197   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|        27       1       9                                                   |
|     + ----x + ----y + ----                                                  |
|       2197    2197    2197                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : pseudoRemainder(y,f,g)                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|      4                                                                      |
|o5 = x                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : R                                                                       |
